# Harness scratch that lands in the REPO ROOT when a probe is run without an
# explicit evidence directory (task 2026-08-06-smoothing-operator-bakeoff, C1).
# Every pattern is ROOT-ANCHORED with a leading slash, so the identically-named
# files that legitimately live under evidence/<task>/ are still tracked — only
# the root copies, which are never legitimate, are ignored.
#
# This is a GUARD, NOT THE FIX. The cause is sdf_geometry_probe.cpp:1482, where
# the part-based modes default their output directory to "." — see the handoff
# for why that default is load-bearing for another task's documented recipe and
# so is not safe to change here.
/sdf_*.stl
/sdf_*.csv
/subject_variant.stl
/sphere_control.stl
/dumbbell.stl
/bracket_export.stl
__pycache__/
